# NOTE: android/key.properties and android/app/simplitor.jks are INTENTIONALLY
# committed so GitHub Actions can sign every build with the same key that is
# registered in Firebase. This is fine for development. Before ever publishing
# to Google Play, regenerate the key and move it to GitHub Secrets.